      "core_meaning_cn": "给人、需求或差异“腾出空间”：可字面容纳，也可满足需要、调整安排或使自己适应",
      "core_meaning_en": "to make room for people, needs, or differences: house, satisfy, adjust, or adapt",
      "mental_model_cn": "看宾语决定分支：number/guests → 容纳；request/need → 满足；plan/view → 调整使兼容；oneself → 使自己适应。bare accommodate to 较少用于主动产出，优先 accommodate oneself to / adapt to。",
      "mental_model_en": "Let the object select the branch: house people, meet a request, adjust something to fit, or accommodate oneself to a situation."
    },
